        "original_id": "30c3eb08-cc9a-556b-ac3a-04de8d3cb7b3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Luca Cordero di Montezemolo\n- Companies: Ferrari, Fiat S.p.A., Fiat Chrysler Automobiles NV (FCA)\n- Organizations: Confindustria, FIEG\n- Places: Italy, Turin, Netherlands\n- Roles: Chairman, President, businessman\n\nFacts:\n- Luca Cordero di Montezemolo was born on 31 August 1947 and is an Italian businessman.\n- Luca Cordero di Montezemolo was formerly Chairman of Ferrari.\n- Luca Cordero di Montezemolo was formerly Chairman of Fiat S.p.A.\n- Luca Cordero di Montezemolo was formerly President of Confindustria and FIEG.\n- Fiat S.p.A., short for Fabbrica Italiana Automobili Torino, was an Italian holding company whose original and core activities were in the automotive industry.\n- Fiat S.p.A. was the former owner of Fiat Group.\n- Fiat S.p.A. was succeeded by Fiat Chrysler Automobiles NV.\n- On 29 January 2014, Fiat S.p.A. announced that it would merge into the new Netherlands-based holding company Fiat Chrysler Automobiles NV.\n- The merger of Fiat S.p.A. into Fiat Chrysler Automobiles NV was completed before the end of 2014.",
